  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-header">

      <div class="section-label">
        Common questions
      </div>

      <h2>
        You might be wondering...
      </h2>

    </div>


    <div class="objection-list">

      <div class="objection">
        <h3>
          "Can't I just find this information myself?"
        </h3>
        <p>
          Yes. The information is already online. The service is designed
          for people who don't want to spend hours figuring out which
          information matters, how it fits together and what to do next.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="objection">
        <h3>
          "Are you actually teaching me?"
        </h3>
        <p>
          No. The roadmap is not a tutoring service or a substitute for
          an instructor. We research and organize the learning path,
          resources, practice and projects so you have a clearer structure
          for teaching yourself.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="objection">
        <h3>
          "What if I'm a complete beginner?"
        </h3>
        <p>
          That's exactly when structure can be useful. Your roadmap is
          built around your stated starting point rather than assuming
          you already know the fundamentals.
        </p>
      </div>


      <div class="objection">
